      "contract": "WinX starts WifiPrepare.efi before Windows Boot Manager. Successful preparation changes the firmware WSTA byte from 0x10 to 0x0f and fixes the DSDT checksum. On failure the firmware leaves the device hidden and continues booting. This build also uses a static Windows ACPI override for NVDEC. The loaded WSTA matches that saved image; reading it alone cannot establish that the firmware preparation succeeded on any individual boot.",
